      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "anchor": "overview"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "MARS_01 applies Enchant Blueprints to Excellion equipment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Excellion enchants work by choosing a blueprint; the chosen blueprint's option is always given."
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "title": "Not a Random Enchant",
      "text": "Neither success nor the option type is random: one blueprint you own is used up and its option is added to the equipment."
    },
